name: SGR 1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 9 set bold, faint, italic, underline, inverse, crossed-out
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[1ma\e[2mb\e[0;3mc\e[0;4md\e[0;7me\e[0;9mf\e[0mg
row 0: |abcdefg|
cell 0,0: char=a bold
cell 1,0: char=b bold dim
cell 2,0: char=c italic
cell 3,0: char=d underline
cell 4,0: char=e inverse
cell 5,0: char=f strike
cell 6,0: char=g plain
---
name: SGR 22, 23, 24, 27, 29 each clear one attribute
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[1;3;4;7;9mA\e[22mB\e[23mC\e[24mD\e[27mE\e[29mF
row 0: |ABCDEF|
cell 0,0: char=A bold italic underline inverse strike
cell 1,0: char=B italic underline inverse strike
cell 2,0: char=C underline inverse strike
cell 3,0: char=D inverse strike
cell 4,0: char=E strike
cell 5,0: char=F plain
---
name: SGR with no parameter is SGR 0
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[1;4;31mA\e[mB
row 0: |AB|
cell 0,0: char=A bold underline fg=1
cell 1,0: char=B plain
---
name: SGR 30-37, 40-47, 39, 49 and aixterm 90-97, 100-107 select palette colors
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[31;42mR\e[39mD\e[49mN\e[91;102mB\e[37;40mW
row 0: |RDNBW|
cell 0,0: char=R fg=1 bg=2
cell 1,0: char=D fg=default bg=2
cell 2,0: char=N plain
cell 3,0: char=B fg=9 bg=10
cell 4,0: char=W fg=7 bg=0
---
name: SGR 38;5 and 48;5 select 256-color palette entries
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[38;5;196mX\e[48;5;21mY\e[38;5;7;48;5;232mZ
row 0: |XYZ|
cell 0,0: char=X fg=196 bg=default
cell 1,0: char=Y fg=196 bg=21
cell 2,0: char=Z fg=7 bg=232
---
name: SGR 38;2 and 48;2 select 24-bit colors
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
size: 80x24
input: \e[38;2;255;128;0mT\e[48;2;0;64;255mU\e[0mV
row 0: |TUV|
cell 0,0: char=T fg=#ff8000 bg=default
cell 1,0: char=U fg=#ff8000 bg=#0040ff
cell 2,0: char=V plain
---
name: SGR colon subparameters: 38:5:Ps and 48:2:Pi:Pr:Pg:Pb
source: xterm ctlseqs (Patch #411) https://invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.txt:1189-1324 CSI Pm m (SGR)
